s in \\"infrastructure\\" satisfy the Protocol, and wire it in the outermost layer (the composition root)."},"locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"shop/domain/order.py","uriBaseId":"%SRCROOT%"},"region":{"startLine":1,"startColumn":8,"endLine":1,"endColumn":30}}}],"properties":{"fix":{"summary":"Depend on an abstraction owned by \\"domain\\" instead of \\"shop.infrastructure.db\\".","steps":["Delete \`import shop.infrastructure.db\`. Do not move the import into a function or behind TYPE_CHECKING; Inwards checks those too.","Declare a typing.Protocol in \`shop.domain\` (for example \`shop.domain.ports\`) that describes only what this module needs from \`db\`.","Type this module against that Protocol and receive the implementation through a constructor or function parameter.","Make the class in \\"infrastructure\\" satisfy the Protocol, and wire it in the outermost layer (the composition root)."]}}}]}]}
